OL,3,AKing leads solemn Remembrance service
OL,4,Aat Cenotaph
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles led the nation in a solemn
OL,7,Ftwo-minute silence on Remembrance
OL,8,FSunday in London to honour veterans who
OL,9,Fhave died in conflict.
OL,11,FOn a stone-grey autumn morning, he laid
OL,12,Fa wreath at the Cenotaph, Whitehall
OL,13,Fbefore a march-past by 10,000 armed
OL,14,Fforces veterans.
OL,16,FThat included a shrinking number of
OL,17,FWorld War Two veterans, with 12 taking
OL,18,Fpart this year, including 103-year-old
OL,19,FAnnie Duplock, who described it as a
OL,20,F"very emotional day".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
